# GCE start VM (before VELA work)

Invoke with `@gce-start`. **Agent runs terminal via Shell; never paste these commands for the user.**

**Goal:** Start `vst-vela-01` and wait until RUNNING before `@gce-run` or `@gce-jupyter`.

**Judgment:** `.cursor/skills/gce-ops/SKILL.md`

| Name | Value |
| :--- | :--- |
| Project ID | `pt-vela` |
| VM | `vst-vela-01` |
| Zone | `europe-west4-a` |
| Default machine | `n1-standard-4` (CPU only, no GPU) |

---

## Agent workflow

From repo root on **Mac**:

```sh
chmod +x scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh
scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh billing-status
scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh start
scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh billing-status
```

**Pass:** `status: RUNNING`, `accelerators: none`.

**Cost warning:** tell the user that RUNNING bills hourly until `@gce-stop`.

If machine type is not `n1-standard-4` and no active export is planned:

```sh
scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh stop
scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh downsize
scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh start
```

